Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;">Precessing top</div>
<button id="btnPlay">▶ Play precession</button>
<label>Tilt angle θ = <span id="thetaVal">25°</span>
